window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>New town. New school. Same lies.</p> <p>This is my senior year, and not only have my parents moved me to a new place where I know nothing and no one, they are determined to make me fall in line with the life they want me to have.</p> <p>Not the life that I want. But what fits perfectly into their world.</p> <p>I'm looking for any possible way to escape this prison and leave them behind. Which has been harder than I thought.</p> <p>An opportunity to escape appears. And I'm going to take it. I'm going to use four so-called perfect guys in this new town to make it happen. The ones that have it all, or so everyone thinks.</p> <p>And they're going to be my ticket out.</p>"; 
